sequenceDiagram
    participant AI as AI Client
    participant GW as Gateway Server
    participant CTX as Context
    participant VAL as Validation Chain
    participant CM as Client Manager
    participant MCP as MCP HTTP Client
    participant DS as Downstream MCP Server

    Note over AI,DS: Credential Flow Through Maybe Don't Gateway

    AI->>GW: HTTP/SSE Request<br/>Headers: X-Github-Token: "secret123"

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over GW,CTX: Credential Extraction (server.go:409-477)
        GW->>GW: extractAuthFromRequest()
        GW->>GW: Check PassThrough.Enabled per client
        GW->>GW: Map headers via CredentialMapping<br/>source_header → target_header
        GW->>CTX: WithServiceCredentials()<br/>Store {github: {Authorization: "secret123"}}
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over GW,VAL: Request Validation
        GW->>VAL: Validate request (ctx)
        VAL->>VAL: CEL Policy Engine
        VAL->>VAL: AI Policy Engine
        VAL-->>GW: Validation Result
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over GW,DS: Credential Injection & Forwarding
        GW->>CM: CallTool(ctx, request)
        CM->>CM: Route to client by prefix<br/>"github__tool" → "github"
        CM->>MCP: Forward request (ctx)
        MCP->>MCP: createAuthHeaderFunc(ctx)
        MCP->>CTX: GetServiceCredentials(ctx, "github")
        CTX-->>MCP: {Authorization: "secret123"}
        MCP->>MCP: Format: "Bearer {value}"<br/>→ "Bearer secret123"
        MCP->>MCP: Merge static headers<br/>(HTTPConfig.Headers)
        MCP->>DS: HTTP Request<br/>Authorization: "Bearer secret123"
    end

    DS-->>MCP: Response
    MCP-->>CM: Response
    CM-->>GW: Response
    GW-->>AI: Response
